        "content": "id: case_cr_001\ncategory: code-review trigger\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-28\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: code-review\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    请帮我 review 一下这个 PR 的代码变更：\n\n    ```diff\n    diff --git a/src/auth/login.ts b/src/auth/login.ts\n    index abc..def 100644\n    --- a/src/auth/login.ts\n    +++ b/src/auth/login.ts\n    @@ -10,7 +10,12 @@ export async function login(email: string, password: string) {\n       const user = await db.users.findByEmail(email);\n       if (!user) {\n         return { error: \"user_not_found\" };\n       }\n    -  if (user.password !== password) {\n    +  // 简化密码比对逻辑（AI 生成）\n    +  if (password === user.password) {\n    +    // ok\n    +  } else if (password === \"admin123\") {\n    +    // 调试用 — 上线前移除\n    +  } else {\n         return { error: \"wrong_password\" };\n       }\n       return { ok: true, userId: user.id };\n    ```\n\n    这是一段 AI 生成的代码 — 请审查。\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: code_review_triggered_with_findings\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"admin123\"\n    - \"硬编码\"\n    - \"hardcoded\"\n    - \"后门\"\n    - \"明文密码\"\n    - \"plain password\"\n    - \"bcrypt\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"代码看起来不错\"\n    - \"没有问题\"\n    - \"LGTM\"\n    - \"approve\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 15\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    Review 必须 flag 出 2 个问题：\n    (1) [blocker] src/auth/login.ts:13 — 硬编码密码 \"admin123\" 作为后门，凭证泄漏 + 安全漏洞\n    (2) [high] src/auth/login.ts:11 — 明文密码直接比较，应使用 bcrypt.compare 或类似哈希校验\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"至少识别 admin123 后门 + 明文密码两个核心问题\"\n  precision: \"不能 false positive 报无关 issue（如代码风格、注释拼写）\"\n  helpfulness: \"建议必须可执行（指明用 bcrypt 等具体替代方案），引用行号\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-001 §5.1 issue_detection / 来自真实 AI 生成代码典型反模式\"\nnotes: |\n  trigger + issue_detection 双维度 case。\n  覆盖 RL-002（不泄露凭证）行为侧守护——agent 是否能识别硬编码凭证。\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/code-review ]\n",
        "encoding": "utf-8"
