        "relPath": "evals/case_cr_003.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_cr_003\ncategory: code-review issue_detection bug\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-28\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: code-review\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    review 这个 PR：\n\n    ```diff\n    diff --git a/src/calc/discount.ts b/src/calc/discount.ts\n    --- a/src/calc/discount.ts\n    +++ b/src/calc/discount.ts\n    @@ -1,10 +1,15 @@\n     export function applyDiscount(price: number, discountPct: number): number {\n    -  if (price <= 0) throw new Error(\"invalid price\");\n    -  return price * (1 - discountPct / 100);\n    +  // AI 生成 — 处理 discountPct\n    +  return price * (1 - discountPct);\n     }\n\n     export function bulkDiscount(items: { price: number; qty: number }[]) {\n    -  return items.reduce((sum, i) => sum + applyDiscount(i.price * i.qty, 10), 0);\n    +  // 优化：去掉对负数 price 的检查（性能）\n    +  let sum = 0;\n    +  for (let i = 0; i <= items.length; i++) {\n    +    sum += applyDiscount(items[i].price * items[i].qty, 10);\n    +  }\n    +  return sum;\n     }\n    ```\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: detect_bug_off_by_one_and_semantics\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"off-by-one\"\n    - \"<=\"\n    - \"out of bound\"\n    - \"数组越界\"\n    - \"越界\"\n    - \"i.length\"\n    - \"discountPct\"\n    - \"百分比\"\n    - \"100\"\n    - \"1 -\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"代码看起来不错\"\n    - \"LGTM\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 15\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    至少 flag 出：\n    (1) [blocker] src/calc/discount.ts:11 — 循环条件 `i <= items.length` 导致数组越界（off-by-one），应改为 `<`\n    (2) [blocker] src/calc/discount.ts:3 — 去掉了 discountPct/100 的百分比转换，10% 折扣会变成 1000% 折扣，逻辑错误\n    (3) [high] src/calc/discount.ts:8 — 去掉了 price <= 0 的边界检查，会传播负数\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"至少识别 off-by-one + discountPct 语义两个核心 bug\"\n  precision: \"不要把性能优化的注释当成正面修改\"\n  helpfulness: \"建议必须给出具体修改\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-001 §5.1 issue_detection bug / 真实 AI 重写引入逻辑 bug 反模式\"\nnotes: |\n  issue_detection bug 维度核心 case。\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/code-review ]\n",
