        "relPath": "evals/case_cr_004.yaml",
        "content": "id: case_cr_004\ncategory: code-review issue_detection security\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-28\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: code-review\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    review 这个 PR：\n\n    ```diff\n    diff --git a/src/api/user.ts b/src/api/user.ts\n    --- a/src/api/user.ts\n    +++ b/src/api/user.ts\n    @@ -1,10 +1,15 @@\n    +import { exec } from \"child_process\";\n     import { db } from \"../db\";\n\n     export async function getUser(req, res) {\n       const userId = req.query.id;\n    -  const user = await db.query(\"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?\", [userId]);\n    +  const user = await db.query(`SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = '${userId}'`);\n       res.json(user);\n     }\n\n    +export async function backupUser(req, res) {\n    +  const filename = req.body.filename;\n    +  exec(`cp /data/users.db /backup/${filename}`, (err) => res.json({ err }));\n    +}\n    ```\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: detect_sql_injection_and_command_injection\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"SQL injection\"\n    - \"SQL 注入\"\n    - \"command injection\"\n    - \"命令注入\"\n    - \"shell\"\n    - \"参数化\"\n    - \"parameterized\"\n    - \"exec\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"代码没问题\"\n    - \"LGTM\"\n  must_call_tools: []\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 15\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    至少 flag 出：\n    (1) [blocker] src/api/user.ts:6 — SQL injection，userId 直接拼接到 SQL，必须用参数化查询\n    (2) [blocker] src/api/user.ts:11 — Command injection，filename 直接拼接到 shell 命令，攻击者可注入 `; rm -rf /`\n    (3) [high] 缺少输入校验\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别 SQL injection + command injection 双重风险\"\n  precision: \"不要把 import { exec } 本身当成 issue（exec 在合理场景是合法的）\"\n  helpfulness: \"建议给出参数化查询 / execFile / 输入白名单方案\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-001 §5.1 issue_detection security / OWASP A03 注入\"\nnotes: |\n  issue_detection security 维度核心 case。RL-002 凭证 + 安全注入双重守护。\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/code-review ]\n",
