        "content": "id: case_cr_010\ncategory: code-review context_awareness\npriority: P0\ncreated_date: 2026-05-28\n\neval_type: capability\ntarget_score: 4.0\ngraduated_at: null\nholdout: false\nholdout_reason: null\nskill: code-review\n\ninput:\n  user_query: |\n    本 PR 是 sid-code 自身仓库的变更：\n\n    ```diff\n    diff --git a/src/agent/loop.ts b/src/agent/loop.ts\n    --- a/src/agent/loop.ts\n    +++ b/src/agent/loop.ts\n    @@ -100,7 +100,12 @@ export class AgentLoopRunner {\n       async run(input: string) {\n         while (true) {\n           const response = await this.llm.stream(input);\n    -      if (response.stopReason === \"end_turn\") return response;\n    +      // AI 优化 — 简化退出条件\n    +      if (response) return response;\n    +      // 处理 tool_use\n           await this.handleToolUse(response);\n         }\n       }\n    ```\n\n    请 review 这个变更，并**引用具体的 file:line** 说明问题。\n  repo: sid-code\n  repo_commit: \"\"\n\nexpected:\n  outcome: review_with_specific_file_line_references\n\n  must_include_any_of:\n    - \"src/agent/loop.ts:\"\n    - \"loop.ts 第\"\n    - \"loop.ts line\"\n    - \"AgentLoopRunner\"\n    - \"stopReason\"\n    - \"end_turn\"\n    - \"tool_use\"\n    - \"无限循环\"\n    - \"无法工作\"\n    - \"破坏\"\n\n  must_not_include:\n    - \"可能存在问题\"\n    - \"may have issue\"\n    - \"请确认\"\n    - \"I'm not sure\"\n    - \"我不确定\"\n  must_call_tools:\n    - read\n  must_not_call_tools:\n    - edit\n    - write\n  must_modify_files_in: []\n  must_not_modify_files:\n    - \"src/\"\n  max_steps: 18\n\n  reference_answer: |\n    [blocker] src/agent/loop.ts:104 — 简化退出条件从 `stopReason === \"end_turn\"` 改为 `if (response)` 是严重错误：\n    response 几乎永远存在（除非 LLM 直接抛错），意味着循环第一次就退出，永远不会 handleToolUse。\n    这破坏了 agentic while-loop 的核心机制（详见 sid-code CLAUDE.md §0.1：当 stop_reason=tool_use 时执行工具并继续循环）。\n\n    Verdict: block\n\n    建议：恢复原来的 `if (response.stopReason === \"end_turn\") return response`，\n    并保留 tool_use 分支的循环继续逻辑。\n\nrubric:\n  completeness: \"识别 agentic while-loop 关键行为变化 + 必须引用 src/agent/loop.ts:NNN 行号\"\n  precision: \"RL-007 (不编造问题) — 每条 flag 必须有具体行号引用，不能用 '可能' / '请确认' 模糊用语\"\n  helpfulness: \"用 read 工具核实 loop.ts 当前结构再判断\"\n\nbaseline_scores: {}\n\nsource: \"RFC-001 §5.1 context_awareness / 与 RL-007 不编造问题强相关\"\nnotes: |\n  context_awareness 维度核心 case。\n  考验：(a) 是否会 read 文件验证 (b) 是否引用具体行号 (c) 是否真理解 agentic while-loop 机制\nrelated_subsystem: [ skill, skill/code-review, agent ]\n",
